# 05_focus_smr_RGB.ledc — Focus / Flow (SMR), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 05_focus_smr. Audio + speech IDENTICAL. The 14 Hz SMR beat is carried
# 100% by AUDIO isochronic modulation; the LED is a STEADY (freq 0), dim, cool lamp the
# ENTIRE session — it NEVER pulses (14 Hz sits at the photosensitive band edge). On this
# build the lamp is an inner cool-white core (mask 9, 180,200,255) + an outer calm-blue
# halo (mask 6, 32,96,255). Brightness capped <=25% working, ramps in, and ENDS BRIGHT
# (40%, on) — a focus session ends alert, never dark. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask   (freq 0 = STEADY, no flicker)

# --- STEADY cool lamp: inner cool-white core + outer calm-blue halo ---
0       0 100 >0 180 200 255 9      # inner core: steady, brightness fade-in from 0
0       0 100 >0 32 96 255 6        # outer halo: steady blue
15000   0 100 20 180 200 255 9      # inner reaches 20% (15 s ramp-in)
15000   0 100 20 32 96 255 6        # outer
300000  0 100 >20 180 200 255 9     # deepening: brightness ramp START 20 ...
300000  0 100 >20 32 96 255 6       # outer
600000  0 100 25 180 200 255 9      # ... TARGET 25% (dim working cap)
600000  0 100 25 32 96 255 6        # outer
1620000 0 100 >25 180 200 255 9     # exit: gentle brighten START 25 ...
1620000 0 100 >25 32 96 255 6       # outer
1800000 0 100 40 180 200 255 9      # ... TARGET 40% — stays ON and BRIGHTENS (alert end)
1800000 0 100 40 32 96 255 6        # outer

# --- Audio ch1: isochronic driver — 300 Hz sine carrier, AUDIO carries the beat ---
A 0       300 0 >0 10 1              # induction: 300 Hz, vol fade-in, beat 10 Hz (alpha)
S 3000 default 52 "Starting at ten hertz, in alpha. Let your attention settle and steady."
A 45000   300 0 55 10 1             # vol settled 55, still 10 Hz
A 300000  300 0 55 >10 1            # deepening: beat ramp START 10 Hz ...
S 300000 default 52 "Rising now toward fourteen hertz, sharpening into calm, alert focus."
A 600000  300 0 60 14 1            # ... TARGET 14 Hz — HOLD begins
S 600000 default 52 "You have reached SMR, fourteen hertz. Hold here, focused and relaxed. Let your work flow."
A 1620000 300 0 60 >14 1           # exit: beat ramp START 14 Hz ...
S 1620000 default 52 "Easing gently toward twelve hertz. Stay alert as the session winds down."
A 1800000 300 0 50 12 1            # ... TARGET 12 Hz — ends ALERT, ON
S 1800000 default 52 "Twelve hertz, alert and clear. Carry this focus with you."

# --- Audio ch2: pink-noise focus bed (wave 5), steady, masks distraction ---
A 0       220 0 >0 0 2 0 5          # pink bed, vol fade-in from 0
A 45000   220 0 20 0 2 0 5         # bed settled at vol 20
A 1620000 220 0 >20 0 2 0 5        # gentle ease START 20 ...
A 1800000 220 0 18 0 2 0 5         # ... TARGET 18 — still ON at alert end
